{"severity":"error","file":"errors/scoped_misplaced_1.march","start_line":4,"start_col":27,"end_line":4,"end_col":38,"message":"`scoped` marks the handle a callback receives, so it is written only before the parameter type of a function type that is itself a function's parameter, as in `fn with_open(path : String, body : scoped File.Handle -> r)`.","code":"scoped_misplaced","fix":null,"labels":[],"notes":[],"category":"CAPABILITY"}
